    "references": [
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.210.050 block 0",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 0,
          "component_id": "c5c3bf4d-ed06-5613-a27e-1d8214090aea",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 198,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.210.050:block:0",
          "start": 0
        },
        "quote": "Cargo containers as an accessory use are permitted in the I-1 and I-2 districts. In all other districts cargo containers are permitted only in accordance with the following provisions and standards.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.210.050:block:0#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.210.050 block 1",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 1,
          "component_id": "1046d4c9-76ac-5485-a194-d78116ec532d",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 415,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.210.050:block:1",
          "start": 199
        },
        "quote": "(a) In a residential zoning district, one cargo container used as a moving pod no larger than 160 square feet and no more than nine feet tall may be used on a temporary basis for up to 30 days within a calendar year.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.210.050:block:1#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.210.050 block 2",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 2,
          "component_id": "edad017b-4b0e-5ab0-8991-07ae600b5d4e",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 624,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.210.050:block:2",
          "start": 416
        },
        "quote": "(b) In a nonresidential or mixed use zoning district, cargo containers no larger than 320 square feet and no more than nine feet tall may be used on a temporary basis for up to 30 days within a calendar year.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.210.050:block:2#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.210.050 block 3",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 3,
          "component_id": "13e9cc60-ca7e-50d6-812e-bbcf80bde4c1",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1101,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.210.050:block:3",
          "start": 625
        },
        "quote": "(c) In commercial zoning districts C-3, C-4, X-2 and where accessory to institutional uses in other zoning districts, cargo containers shall not be visible from a public street either by placement or opaque fence/landscape screening. Any cargo container only visible from the front of buildings on adjacent property shall be set against the primary building and color matched with the building, and shall be limited to one cargo container. In addition, cargo containers shall:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.210.050:block:3#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.210.050 block 4",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 4,
          "component_id": "faaf220b-9232-5d04-9c49-368ee7631e52",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1188,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.210.050:block:4",
          "start": 1102
        },
        "quote": "(1) Not displace or interfere with required parking, circulation, or emergency access;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.210.050:block:4#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.210.050 block 5",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 5,
          "component_id": "f8f53e93-cd5c-5b89-b3ae-8c21d8af0609",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1272,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.210.050:block:5",
          "start": 1189
        },
        "quote": "(2) Not be used as a base, platform, or location for business identification signs;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.210.050:block:5#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.210.050 block 6",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 6,
          "component_id": "36c1b4c5-dee2-5a98-a1ff-b6b9600d664b",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1371,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.210.050:block:6",
          "start": 1273
        },
        "quote": "(3) Not be located in any required front or side yard setback adjoining a street right-of-way; and",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.210.050:block:6#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.210.050 block 7",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 7,
          "component_id": "931f0efc-9af4-54c1-b86b-32fd892d7459",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1418,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.210.050:block:7",
          "start": 1372
        },
        "quote": "(4) Be located at grade level and not stacked.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.210.050:block:7#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.210.050 block 8",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 8,
          "component_id": "b71c0923-c0bf-5940-a8de-17caf07dd36a",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1509,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.210.050:block:8",
          "start": 1419
        },
        "quote": "(d) Exceptions to the requirements in subsections (a) through (c) of this section include:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.210.050:block:8#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.210.050 block 9",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 9,
          "component_id": "4a503bda-a7d7-53ce-b03d-9161ff36bd4c",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1761,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.210.050:block:9",
          "start": 1510
        },
        "quote": "(1) Cargo containers used for allowed on-site construction purposes for a period not to exceed the duration of a construction project with a valid building permit and for no more than 180 days for construction projects not requiring a building permit.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.210.050:block:9#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.210.050 block 10",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 10,
          "component_id": "a159d931-3a05-57a2-9941-b7601aba9ae9",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1866,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.210.050:block:10",
          "start": 1762
        },
        "quote": "(2) Cargo containers used where accessory to public or institutional athletic fields as the primary use.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.210.050:block:10#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.210.050 block 11",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 11,
          "component_id": "5b40b35d-3762-5099-abfe-d8b5ff5ec58a",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2065,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.210.050:block:11",
          "start": 1867
        },
        "quote": "(e) Any legally existing cargo containers made nonconforming on the effective date of the ordinance codified in this section shall conform on or before September 1, 2017. (Ord. 20062 § 34, 4-18-17.)",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.210.050:block:11#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
